pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: the same unguarded bookkeeping in the i128 fallback of
% `Cardinality::add`. The degree sum is i128::MIN + 2 and the three merges cancel 3, so the
% true degree is i128::MIN - 1. The formula is satisfiable (all three variables true).
f 2 ;
pol 1 2 + ;
output NONE;
conclusion UNSAT : 3 ;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
